# Interactive VLM Feedback Loop — Deployment Secrets
#
# Local source: copy this file to ~/.vlm_feedback_loop/.env.
# Docker Compose: copy it to ./.env at the repository root; Compose does not
# read the source-mode file under ~/.vlm_feedback_loop.
# Fill in only the values needed for the selected deployment mode. Compose
# supports hosted or operator-managed endpoints; system-managed local NIMs use
# source mode because the Compose backend has no Docker CLI or socket.
#
# This file carries deployment secrets plus values Docker Compose interpolates.
# Source-mode application settings live in ~/.vlm_feedback_loop/config.yaml —
# see config.yaml.example. Compose uses the supported non-secret overrides below
# instead of that host-local file.
#
# Commands read credentials from this file or their process environment.
# Secret-valued CLI flags are deliberately unsupported so credential values
# never enter process argument vectors.

# ── Docker Compose settings (non-secret) ─────────────────
# The Blueprint has no authentication and binds to loopback by default.
# Change this only on a trusted network with an external access-control layer.
# EDGE_BIND_HOST=127.0.0.1
# EDGE_PORT=3000
# Absolute host directory exposed at the same path inside the backend. Omit it
# to use the bundled sample mounted at /data/images.
# IMAGE_ROOT=/absolute/path/to/images
# LOG_LEVEL=info
# TAO_JOB_TIMEOUT_MINUTES=1440
# TAO_QUANTIZATION_CALIBRATION_SAMPLES=128
# Leave false unless /home/appuser is persisted and UI-written keys are wanted.
# ALLOW_UI_SECRET_PERSIST=false
# Container images do not include .git. Set this to `git rev-parse HEAD` when
# a containerized backend will run external-endpoint Student benchmarks.
# VLM_FEEDBACK_LOOP_BUILD_SHA=

# ── NVIDIA Hosted NIM (API Catalog) ───────────────────────
# Required for hosted Teacher inference and hosted image embeddings
# (NeMo Retriever VL 1B v2). Get a key at
# https://build.nvidia.com/settings/api-keys
# NVIDIA_API_KEY=nvapi-...

# ── NGC (Local NIM Container Pulls) ──────────────────────
# Required only for system-managed local NIM deployment in source mode.
# Docker Compose intentionally does not forward this value because its backend
# cannot orchestrate local containers.
# Get a key at https://org.ngc.nvidia.com/setup/api-key
# NGC_API_KEY=...

# ── Hugging Face (Student base weight downloads) ─────────
# Used by Student Training's first-use base provisioning and passed to the
# TAO/cosmos-rl training driver (as both HF_TOKEN and
# HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN) for gated Hub access.
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# ── TAO (Student Training) ───────────────────────────────
# Required when Student Training is enabled. Operator-input config:
# TAO_API_BASE_URL=https://<tao-host>/api/v2
# TAO_API_KEY=...
# TAO_ORG_NAME=...

# ── TAO workspace S3 credentials (secrets only) ──────────
# Required when Student Training is enabled. The daemon resolves these
# by env-var name at runtime; deployment.db.tao_deployment_configs
# stores only the reference label, not the secret value.
# TAO_WORKSPACE_S3_ACCESS_KEY=...
# TAO_WORKSPACE_S3_SECRET_KEY=...
#
# Note: non-secret TAO workspace state (workspace_id, bucket name, S3
# endpoint URLs) lives in deployment.db, not here. The
# `vlm-feedback-loop tao-bootstrap` command writes it there.
